# round-31: `.str()`/`.as_str()` were removed as redundant deep-copy self-view
# accessors (bare `String v = sb` is already a zero-cost CoW borrow). Calling
# them — or any unknown method — on a primitive receiver must now be a CLEAN
# type error at `gg check`. Before the reject (semantic/typecheck.rs #1) this
# fell through typecheck with no error and the LIR invented a bogus
# `gorget_str_str` runtime symbol → link error or silent miscompile.
void main():
    String s = "hi"
    print(s.str())
